{"sourceUrl":"https://slxy.cug.edu.cn/info/1017/13519.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:31.824850+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://slxy.cug.edu.cn/info/1017/13519.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>数学与物理学院</span></span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>生</span></span></p><p><span><span>招</span></span><span><span>生录取工作</span></span><span><span>办法</span></span></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><span><span>根据《中国地质大学</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>武汉</span></span><span><span>）</span>2027</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>生招</span></span><span><span>生录取工作</span></span><span><span>办法</span></span><span><span>》</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>地大研发〔</span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>〕</span></span><span>5</span><span>0</span><span><span>号</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>文件精神，为做好</span></span><span><span>数学与物理学院</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>生招</span></span><span><span>生录取工作，</span></span><span><span>特制定本办法</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>一、指导思想</span></span></p><p><span><span>数学与物理学院</span>2027<span>年接收</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>生招生录取工作</span></span><span><span>围绕落实立德树人根本任务</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>以提高质量为核心，</span></span><span><span>坚持</span></span><span><span>科学、规范、公平的原则，</span></span><span><span>以德为先、全面衡量、择优选拔，</span></span><span><span>不断加强监督管理，切实严明招生纪律，</span></span><span><span>着力选拔培养拔尖创新人才</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>二、接收推免生学科专业及</span></span><span><span>招生</span></span><span><span>计划</span></span></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span><span>专业代码</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>专业名称</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>接收</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>推免生类型</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>接收推免生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>计划数</span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>070100</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>数学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>直博生</span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>1</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>070800</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地球物理学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>直博生</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>025200</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>应用统计</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士生</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>21</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>070100</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>数学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士生</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>24</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>070200 </span></p></td><td><p><span><span>物理学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士生</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>2</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085600</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>材料与化工</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士生</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>1</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span><span>三、申请条件</span></span></p><p><span>1.<span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>具有推荐免试资格高校的应届本科毕业生，并获得所在院校推荐免试资格，推荐手续完备，材料齐全。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>本科在校期间学习成绩优异，诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span><span>数学与物理学院</span></span><span><span>欢迎并鼓励优秀生源以本科直博方式在</span></span><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span>深造</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>申请考生需先跟博士生导师联系确认接收意向。</span></span></p><p><span><span>①</span><span>选拔条件：本科阶段学习成绩优良；通过英语六级考试，或托福、雅思通过留学资格</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>或有三个月以上的国外留学经历，或以第一作者发表过英文文章；具有一定科研经历并获得全国性学科竞赛奖励，或在</span>T5<span>及以上分区期刊上发表学术论文，或获得授权国家发明专利。</span></span></p><p><span><span>②</span><span>选拔程序：具有学术型推荐免试资格的申请考生，在复试前提出申请</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>在复试情况表上注明</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>，经博士生导师同意，通过复试考核无异议，在教育部</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>开放后，完成系统报名和录取，申请类型选择</span><span>“</span><span>直博生</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>四、接收程序</span></span></p><p><span>1. 8<span>月</span><span>31</span><span>日，学校已开启推免生预报名工作，</span></span><span><span>具有推荐免试资格的申请考生</span></span><span><span>均可报名。所有正式报名工作均需在研招网推免系统完成。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>提交申请材料。申请考生请于</span></span><strong><span>9<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>8</span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>12</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span>00</span></strong><span><span>前</span></span><span><span>填</span></span><span><span>写</span></span><span><span>【腾讯文档】中国地质大学（武汉）数学与物理学院</span>2027<span>年接收推免生报名材料收集  <a href=\"https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DYXpDUWVBU0RkTUFO#/fill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DYXpDUWVBU0RkTUFO#/fill</span></span></a></span></span></p><p><span><span>①</span><span>二代居民身份证、学生证原件扫描件</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>②</span><span>历年在校学习成绩单原件</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>盖推荐院校教务部门公章</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>③</span><span>其他各种能力证明材料</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>如大学英语四、六级考试成绩单、获奖证书、学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>材料审查评议。</span></span><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span>对申请考生的材料进行审查、评议，确定复试名单。</span></span><strong><span>9<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>前</span></span><span><span>，分批向申请考生发出复试通知。</span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span><span>报名并参加综合考核</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span>9<span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span><span>9:00</span><span>，研招网</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>开通推免生报名功能，</span></span><span><span>推免生正式开始网上报名。</span></span><span>9<span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日</span><span>8:00</span><span>开始</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span>开始发送复试通知，请考生注意及时</span></span><span><span>接收复试通知。</span></span><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span>将通过线上形式组织开展综合考核，请考生按时参加。具体时间和综合考核安排另行通知。</span></span><strong><span><span>已报名</span></span></strong><span><span>考</span></span><span><span>生</span></span><span><span>请注意及时接收相关通知并</span></span><span><span>按要求参加综合考核。</span></span></p><p><span>5.<span>完成录取手续。</span></span><span>9<span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日</span><span>8:00</span><span>开始，</span></span><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span>通过</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>发送待录取通知</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span>9<span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日</span><span>14:00</span></span> <span><span>开始，请考生及时接收</span></span><span><span>待录取通知</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>接收待录取通知的申请</span></span><span><span>考生名单经公示无异议后列入正式录取名单，不再参加统考。</span></span></p><p><span>6.</span><span><span>网报期间，</span></span><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span>将根据报名情况适时</span></span><span><span>组织</span></span><span><span>综合考核和</span></span><span><span>录取</span></span><span><span>工作</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>请考生保持电话畅通。</span></span></p><p><span><span>五、复试</span></span><span><span>录取</span></span></p><p><span>1</span><span>.<span>资格审核</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>我院依据</span></span><span><span>材料严格核对考生的申请信息，按接收条件严格审查申请考生的申请资格。</span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.<span>复试形</span></span><span><span>式</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span>采取线上</span></span> <span><span>方</span></span><span><span>式进行复试。</span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.<span>复试时间</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>根据报名情况适时组织，以电话或邮件形式通知相关考生，请考生保持电话或邮件畅通。</span></span><span><span>【数学和应用统计专业第一批次复试时间预计为</span> 9 <span>月 </span><span>20 </span><span>日，复试考生名单将通过电子邮件形式通知】</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>4</span><span>.<span>复试内容</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）专业能力及综合素质面试（满分</span><span>100</span><span>，权重</span><span>80%</span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span>全面考核学生对本学科（专业）理论知识和应用技能掌握程度，利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力，对本学科发展动态的了解以及在本专业领域发展的潜力，创新精神、创新能力及综合素质等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）</span></span><span><span>英语</span></span><span><span>自我介绍</span></span><span><span>（满分</span>100<span>，权重</span><span>20%</span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><span>5</span><span>.</span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>成绩结果按百分制评分，保留至小数点后两位。</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>成绩</span>=</span><span><span>专业能力及综合素质（</span></span><span><span>满分</span>100<span>，权重</span><span>80%</span></span><span><span>）</span>+<span>英语听说（</span></span><span><span>满分</span>100<span>，权重</span><span>20%</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>6</span><span>.</span><span><span>录取规则</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>按照申请考生复试成绩排序确定拟录取名单。</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>成绩不合格不予录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>、其他事项</span></span></p><p><span>1.<span>申请考生必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性，一旦发现申请考生提交的信息不真实或不准确，</span></span><span><span>数学与物理学院</span></span><span><span>将不予录取或取消录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>复试名单、复试成绩及拟录取名单在</span></span><span><span>数学与物理学院</span></span><span><span>官网公示。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>复试和拟录取阶段不组织体检，拟录取的推免生参加新生入学体检。</span></span></p><p><span>4</span><span>.<span>我校确定接收的推免生，在入学报到时未获得本科毕业证书者，学校将取消其录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span>5.</span><span><span>监督与申诉渠道</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>研究生院招生管理办公室：电话：</span>027-67885153<span>，邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:yzb@cug.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>yzb@cug.edu.cn</span></span></a><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>6.</span><span><span>联系方式</span></span></p><p><span><span>通讯地址：湖北省武汉市洪山区鲁磨路</span>388<span>号中国地质大学</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>武汉</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>数学与物理</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span><span>A</span><span>1516</span><span><span>办公室，邮政编码：</span>430074  </span></p><p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>吴老师</span></span><span>  <span>联系电话：</span></span><span>027-67883091  </span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span>wuyaling@cug.edu.cn</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>数学与物理</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span>6</span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"73fb7e4a827154946f07a47c81aa7405d46adeef3a4a902be6ed58606640b6e1","textLength":2189,"sourceSha256":"e6cff046f09f736fa1f65524c850bac5951ad837b333bb10639473be085fe089","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-bcea99971328b9242977","title":"2026年中国地质大学（武汉）数学与物理学院2027年接收推免生招生录取工作办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:31.824850+00:00"}
